---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: The Abstract
lang: en
description: "The Abstract — Reading the Content Economy from Europe. A newsletter by Claudio Cammarano."
---

<div class="newsletter-content">
    <h1>The Abstract</h1>
    <p class="abstract-tagline">Reading the Content Economy from Europe</p>

    <p>The Abstract is the English-language counterpart of this site. It is a newsletter about what happens to publishing, media, and cultural production in the age of generative AI and fragmenting platforms — written from a European perspective, for readers who share the questions but not the language.</p>

    <p>It began here in 2017 as an Italian blog and was relaunched in 2026 as a long-form newsletter on Substack. New essays appear once or twice a month. The Italian work — on education, publishing, semiotics, and the Italian intellectual tradition — continues on this site; The Abstract is where the same questions travel in English.</p>

    <div class="abstract-ctas">
        <a href="https://claudiocammarano.substack.com/p/the-abstract-eight-years-later" class="btn-about">Read the latest issue →</a>
        <a href="https://claudiocammarano.substack.com" class="btn-about btn-about--outline">Subscribe to the newsletter →</a>
    </div>

    {% if abstract.posts and abstract.posts.length > 0 %}
    <h2>Recent essays</h2>
    {% for post in abstract.posts %}
    <article class="abstract-essay-card">
      <div class="article-meta">
        {% if post.date %}<span class="article-date">{{ post.date }}</span>{% endif %}
        <span class="article-tag">The Abstract</span>
      </div>
      <h3 class="abstract-essay-card-title">
        <a href="{{ post.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ post.title }} ↗</a>
      </h3>
      {% if loop.index0 == 0 and post.excerpt %}
      <p class="abstract-block-post-excerpt">{{ post.excerpt }}</p>
      {% elif loop.index0 > 0 and post.subtitle %}
      <p class="abstract-block-post-excerpt">{{ post.subtitle }}</p>
      {% endif %}
    </article>
    {% endfor %}
    {% endif %}
</div>
